{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/qYz7Ft2r1DaGXVgb7MQiMQ","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:56:38.626342+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/qYz7Ft2r1DaGXVgb7MQiMQ","html":"<div><p><span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/MA4zuCUH1j8WIFk80xeHiaROzdKsU7loFZ4XNZPCNarUDxKWD3TqIJQ9Yx0SZNiaFao0w5NiaWvI9gxfDfAyZ5RF3CVLTaTwEDibPQ1tUiaDo3Cg/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section></section><section></section><section></section><section></section><section></section><section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><span><strong><span>单位简介</span></strong></span></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>北京航天控制仪器研究所创建于1960年1月1日，是我国最早组建的惯性技术专业化科研单位，是我国航天惯性技术的奠基者和国家队。</span></span></p><p><span><span>研究所是国务院首批批准的学位授予单位，具有</span><strong><span>“控制科学与工程”“仪器科学与技术”</span></strong><span>专业博士学位授予权一级学科点，</span><strong><span>“电子信息”</span></strong><span>专业类别博士学位授权点，并设有</span><strong><span>“控制科学与工程”</span></strong><span>学科博士后流动站，从1981年开始招收研究生，先后培养博士后、博士及硕士近500人。</span></span></p><p><span><span>研究所位于北京五棵松，现有职工1500人，集聚</span><strong><span>“七一勋章”获得者、两院院士、国家级专家、大国工匠</span></strong><span>等高层次人才，现有包括中国科学院院士在内的研究生导师50余名，均遴选自相关型号专家。在读研究生直接参与重大课题研究，与工程实践紧密结合；在读期间享受助学、助研等福利补贴，生活保障到位。</span></span></p></section></section></section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/MA4zuCUH1j9rS4jIjWicdBSn21eEgwqcHV9K0EQaU8kAicpaDT5fkm23VAuY5icSy6BHqxPdlomWKGym9gInDP47icuskf6jrVJB1xjDJO7y3dc/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;f